{"name": "Amiko Legends", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHARM - RISK - EXTRACT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with Amiko and venture into an untamed world shaped by your actions and those of other players. Every expedition carries risk. Charm wild Amiko to gain an edge, but collecting valuable creatures and scarce resources creates constant tension, forcing you to decide how far to push. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/extras/628c52315cca1767add09de83de3aa0c.poster.avif?t=1784644454\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/extras/628c52315cca1767add09de83de3aa0c.webm?t=1784644454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/extras/628c52315cca1767add09de83de3aa0c.mp4?t=1784644454\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COLLECT &amp; BOND WITH AMIKO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two Amikos are alike! Each has its own personality, natural gifts, and quiet strengths that shape how you explore together. Find the ones that click with your style, and build something that feels personal to every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Collect and Bond with Amiko\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/extras/13bfc1b81999309518eee15684158d10.poster.avif?t=1784644454\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/extras/13bfc1b81999309518eee15684158d10.webm?t=1784644454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/extras/13bfc1b81999309518eee15684158d10.mp4?t=1784644454\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHAPE THE WORLD OF OKIMA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your actions shape more than your own journey. Amiko populations shift, ecosystems respond, and discoveries change over time as players collectively influence the world around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Shape the World\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/extras/56f896120900a4245af2bfcd63124719.poster.avif?t=1784644454\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/extras/56f896120900a4245af2bfcd63124719.webm?t=1784644454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/extras/56f896120900a4245af2bfcd63124719.mp4?t=1784644454\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD YOUR TEAM, ADAPT &amp; GROW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The right team isn't fixed, it's built. Each Amiko's traits, elemental attributes, and star rating open up different strategies for different situations. Shift your lineup for tough expeditions, lean into specific environments, or find the combination that gives you the edge in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Build Your Team\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/extras/559378201d7005d8c58e3f000c5fbd62.poster.avif?t=1784644454\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/extras/559378201d7005d8c58e3f000c5fbd62.webm?t=1784644454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/extras/559378201d7005d8c58e3f000c5fbd62.mp4?t=1784644454\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Charm - Risk - Extract. Only what you extract is yours to keep! Team up with Amiko and venture into an untamed world shaped by your actions and those of other players.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245930/43aa4ce8bc6856c16d76b32c2ad86dbb20c6641f/header.jpg?t=1784644454", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Exploration", "RPG", "Creature Collector", "PvE", "PvP", "Party-Based RPG"], "developers": "Aurory", "publishers": "Aurory", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4245930", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "16 June 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/iZs7K1IClB4", "first_seen": 1781568000.0, "review_rank": 388}